    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index climbed 528 points week-on-week to the highest level since March at 7,545. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage rate jumped by $1.00/t to $10.75/t, while there was a $1,750/day increase in the round-voyage rate to $16,750/day.",
